msgstr "2 秒"

msgid "How to Play"
msgstr "玩法说明"

msgid "Got It"
msgstr "明白了"

msgid "Room %s   /   %s"
msgstr "关卡 %s   /   %s"

msgid "Paused"
msgstr "已暂停"

msgid "Resume"
msgstr "继续"

msgid "Hint"
msgstr "提示"

msgid "Cancel Edit"
msgstr "取消修改"

msgid "Edit Last Echo"
msgstr "修改最后一段回声"

msgid "Restart Room"
msgstr "重开本关"

msgid "Choose Room"
msgstr "选择关卡"

msgid "Room Complete"
msgstr "关卡完成"

msgid "%s Complete"
msgstr "%s · 完成"

msgid "Next Room"
msgstr "下一关"

msgid "Next Chapter"
msgstr "下一章"

msgid "Beats  %d    ·    Echoes  %d"
msgstr "拍数  %d    ·    回声  %d"

msgid "Move one tile per beat. Press Enter to leave an echo. Z undoes a beat. R restarts the room and clears all echoes."
msgstr "每走一格，时间前进一拍。按 Enter 留下回声，按 Z 撤销一拍，按 R 重开本关并清空所有回声。"

msgid "L is a lens. Two selves on its tile open the L gate for the next move. Two echoes count, even when you are elsewhere."
msgstr "L 是透镜。两个自己同时站在上面，下一步就能通过 L 门。即使你在别处，两个回声也能开启它。"

msgid "Cross an arrow in its marked direction. It reverses after the crossing."
msgstr "沿箭头标记的方向穿过门。通过后，箭头会反向。"

msgid "Step onto a diamond to swap the raised and folded bridges. If the bridge beneath you folds, you can step off it."
msgstr "踩上菱形开关，两组桥交替展开、收起。脚下的桥收起时，你仍然可以走出去。"

msgid "Echoes follow their recorded routes and still trigger devices. If two actors trigger the same device on one beat, it changes once."
msgstr "回声始终沿录制路线行动，并触发机关。同一拍有两人触发同一个机关，它只变化一次。"

msgid "Move one tile with the arrow keys, WASD, or a click on an adjacent tile. Each move advances one beat.\n\nPress Enter to leave an echo and return to the start. It retraces your steps, then fades on the beat after its last move.\n\nA plate opens its matching gate. Cross while the gate is open. Guide the solid dot into the outlined square to finish.\n\nZ undoes a step. R restarts the room and clears all echoes."
msgstr "用方向键、WASD，或点击相邻格来移动。每走一格，时间前进一拍。\n\n按 Enter 留下回声，并回到起点。回声会重走你的路线，在最后一步的下一拍消散。\n\n压板会开启对应的门，趁门开着时通过。让实心圆点走进方框出口，即可完成关卡。\n\n按 Z 撤销一步，按 R 重开本关并清空所有回声。"

msgid "First Trace"
msgstr "初迹"

msgid "Walk to A and press Enter to leave an echo. Then take the path to the exit."
msgstr "走到 A，按 Enter 留下回声。然后沿另一条路走向出口。"

msgid "Your echo retraces one step each time you move."
msgstr "你每走一步，回声也会沿着过去的路线走一步。"

msgid "Step onto A and leave an echo. Take the other path in the next round."
msgstr "站上 A 后留下回声，下一轮沿另一条路前进。"

msgid "Record ↑ ↑, then leave the echo. Reach the exit with → → → →."
msgstr "录制 ↑ ↑，然后留下回声。再用 → → → → 到达出口。"

msgid "Scenic Route"
msgstr "迂回"

msgid "Your echo fades after its last move. Time its arrival at A to match yours at the gate."
msgstr "回声走完路线后会消散。让它到达 A 的时刻，与你到达门前的时刻一致。"

msgid "The short path reaches A in two moves. The gate is four moves from the start."
msgstr "最短路线只需两步就能到 A，但你需要四步才能到门前。"

msgid "Take the upper loop to reach A two beats later."
msgstr "沿上方绕行一圈，让回声晚两拍到达 A。"

msgid "Record ↑ → ↑ ←. Leave the echo, then take five steps right."
msgstr "录制 ↑ → ↑ ←，留下回声，再向右走五步。"

msgid "Refrain"
msgstr "复奏"

msgid "Both gates open when someone steps on A. Your echo can visit A twice."
msgstr "有人踩住 A 时，两扇门都会打开。你的回声可以两次经过 A。"

msgid "The gates close as soon as A is empty."
msgstr "A 上一旦无人，门就会关闭。"

msgid "After opening the first gate, have your echo step off A and back onto it."
msgstr "打开第一扇门后，让回声离开 A，再走回 A。"

msgid "Record ↑ ↑ ↓ ↑. Leave the echo, then take five steps right."
msgstr "录制 ↑ ↑ ↓ ↑，留下回声，再向右走五步。"

msgid "Relay Line"
msgstr "接力"

msgid "One echo can open both gates. Send it past A on the way to B."
msgstr "一个回声也能打开两扇门。让它先经过 A，再走向 B。"

msgid "Select a distant plate to see its gate. A opens the first gate and B opens the second."
msgstr "点击远处的压板可查看对应的门。A 开启第一扇，B 开启第二扇。"

msgid "The upper passage connects A to B."
msgstr "上方的通道连着 A 和 B。"

msgid "Record ↑ ↑ → → → →. Leave the echo, then take seven steps right."
msgstr "录制 ↑ ↑ → → → →，留下回声，再向右走七步。"

msgid "Two Voices"
msgstr "双声"

msgid "Use two echoes to reach A and B on the same beat."
msgstr "让两个回声在同一拍分别到达 A 和 B。"

msgid "One echo must be on A and one on B, with you at the gate."
msgstr "一个回声站在 A，一个站在 B，而你要站在门前。"

msgid "Both echoes reach their plates on beat four. Find a four-step path to the gate."
msgstr "两个回声都在第四拍到达压板。你也需要一条四步到达门前的路线。"

msgid "Echo 1  ← ← ↑ ↑     Echo 2  → → ↑ ↑     Exit  ← ↑ ↑ → ↑"
msgstr "回声 1  ← ← ↑ ↑     回声 2  → → ↑ ↑     出口  ← ↑ ↑ → ↑"

msgid "Interlace"
msgstr "交织"

msgid "Let the first echo open a path for the second. Then use both to reach the exit."
msgstr "让第一个回声为第二个开路，再借助两者走向出口。"

msgid "A opens the passage to B. The exit gate needs both B and C."
msgstr "A 开启通往 B 的路。出口的门需要同时踩住 B 和 C。"

msgid "Send the first echo through A to C. The second can then pass the gate and reach B."
msgstr "让第一个回声经过 A 到达 C，第二个就能穿过门，到达 B。"

msgid "Echo 1  ← ← ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑     Echo 2  → → ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑     Exit  ← ↑ → ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑"
msgstr "回声 1  ← ← ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑     回声 2  → → ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑     出口  ← ↑ → ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑"

msgid "Turnabout"
msgstr "回转"

msgid "Cross the arrow once to turn it around."
msgstr "穿过箭头门一次，它就会反向。"

msgid "The lower path needs A first and B second. The upper path reaches B first."
msgstr "下方路线需要先踩 A，再踩 B，但上方路线先经过 B。"

msgid "Record a trip past B to A, then come back through the reversed arrow."
msgstr "录下经过 B 到达 A 的路线，再穿过已经反向的门返回。"

msgid "Echo  ↑ ↑ → → → ← ←     Exit  eight steps right."
msgstr "回声  ↑ ↑ → → → ← ←     出口  向右八步。"

msgid "Tidal Shift"
msgstr "潮汐"

msgid "Step on the diamond to swap the two bridges. The change lasts until the next visit."
msgstr "踩上菱形开关，两组桥就会交换状态，直到下次踩中开关。"

msgid "Your first crossing needs the folded bridge. Your second crossing needs the other bank."
msgstr "第一次过桥需要展开当前收起的桥，第二次需要另一组桥。"

msgid "Return to the diamond as your other self reaches the stone between the bridges."
msgstr "当另一个自己走到两座桥之间的石台时，让回声再次踩中菱形。"

msgid "Echo  ↑ ↑ ↓ ↑     Exit  six steps right."
msgstr "回声  ↑ ↑ ↓ ↑     出口  向右六步。"

msgid "Crosscurrent"
msgstr "错流"

msgid "Two routes share one turnstile. A recorded echo always follows its original path."
msgstr "两条路线共用一扇转向门。录下的回声始终沿原来的路线行动。"

msgid "The lower lane takes two beats longer to reach the arrow. Give that lane to the echo."
msgstr "下方路线到达箭头门需要多走两拍，把这条路留给回声。"

msgid "Cross, step back, then cross again. When both of you land on the diamond together, it switches only once."
msgstr "穿过门，退一步，再次穿过。你和回声同拍踏上菱形时，开关只切换一次。"

msgid "Echo  ↓ → → ↑ ↑ ↓ ↑ ↑ ← ←     Exit  → → ↑ ↓ ↑ ↑ ← ← ← ↑ ↑."
msgstr "回声  ↓ → → ↑ ↑ ↓ ↑ ↑ ← ←     出口  → → ↑ ↓ ↑ ↑ ← ← ← ↑ ↑"

msgid "Counterpoint"
msgstr "对位"

msgid "One echo opens the bridge. The next swaps it back. Both must finish at the exit plates."
msgstr "一个回声展开桥，另一个再把它切换回来。最后，两者都要到达出口所需的压板。"

msgid "The left diamond opens both folded bridges. A lets the second echo reach the right diamond."
msgstr "左侧菱形会展开两座收起的桥。A 让第二个回声到达右侧菱形。"

msgid "Send echo one through the arrow, back to A, then to C. Send echo two over the right bridge and through the A gate to B."
msgstr "第一个回声穿过箭头门，返回 A，再去 C。第二个穿过右侧桥和 A 门，走到 B。"

msgid "Echo 1  ←←←↑↑↑↓→←↓↓←     Echo 2  →→→→↑↑↑↑↑←←↓     Exit  ←←←↑↑→→→↑↑↑←↑."
msgstr "回声 1  ←←←↑↑↑↓→←↓↓←     回声 2  →→→→↑↑↑↑↑←←↓     出口  ←←←↑↑→→→↑↑↑←↑"

msgid "First Contact"
msgstr "初遇"

msgid "Find L, the lens. Two selves on its tile open the marked gate."
msgstr "找到透镜 L。两个自己同时站在上面，就能开启标有 L 的门。"

msgid "The two arms take the same number of steps."
msgstr "两侧的支路需要相同的步数。"

msgid "End one recording on L. Come up the other arm and meet it there."
msgstr "让一段录制停在 L，然后从另一侧走来，与它在此相遇。"

msgid "Echo  ← ↑ ↑ →     Exit  → ↑ ↑ ← ↑ ↑"
msgstr "回声  ← ↑ ↑ →     出口  → ↑ ↑ ← ↑ ↑"

msgid "Borrowed Light"
msgstr "借光"

msgid "After you meet at L, the two bridges need opposite banks on consecutive beats."
msgstr "在 L 相遇后，接连两拍需要不同组的桥展开。"

msgid "The bridge touching L must be raised as you leave the lens."
msgstr "离开透镜时，紧挨着 L 的桥必须展开。"

msgid "Let your echo take one more step after the meeting. While you step onto the first bridge, it can reach the switch."
msgstr "相遇后让回声再走一步。你踏上第一座桥时，它就能踩中开关。"

msgid "Echo  → ↑ ↑ ← ←     Exit  → ↑ ↑ ← ↑ ↑ ↑"
msgstr "回声  → ↑ ↑ ← ←     出口  → ↑ ↑ ← ↑ ↑ ↑"

msgid "Confluence"
msgstr "合流"

msgid "The first gate needs two different places. The last needs the same place twice."
msgstr "第一扇门需要两人分处两地，最后一扇需要两人同处一格。"

msgid "At the elbow in the lower passage, look at where both echoes must be."
msgstr "走到下方通道的拐角时，想想两个回声分别应该在哪里。"

msgid "Send an echo to each plate. After that beat, have both paths turn inward to the lens."
msgstr "让两个回声各去一块压板，随后都向内转弯，走向透镜。"

msgid "Echo 1  ← ← ↑ ↑ → →     Echo 2  → → ↑ ↑ ← ←     Exit  ↓ ↓ → → → ↓ ↓"
msgstr "回声 1  ← ← ↑ ↑ → →     回声 2  → → ↑ ↑ ← ←     出口  ↓ ↓ → → → ↓ ↓"

msgid "Totality"
msgstr "全食"

msgid "A recorded crossing survives even when the bridge beneath it folds."
msgstr "即使桥已经收起，录下的回声仍能沿原来的路线穿过。"

msgid "Record on the original bank. Both echoes must reach L, then return to their separate plates."
msgstr "在桥的初始状态下录制。两个回声都要到达 L，再各自回到压板。"

msgid "In the last round, flip the bank on your way to the lens gate. Your echoes can cross the folded bridges on the way back."
msgstr "最后一轮，在走向 L 门的途中切换桥。回声返回时，依然能穿过收起的桥。"

msgid "Echo 1  ↑ ↑ ← ← ← ↓ ↓ ↑ ↑ → →     Echo 2  ↓ ↓ ← ← ← ↑ ↑ ↓ ↓ → →     Exit  → → ↓ ↓ ↓ → → ↑ ↑ ↑ → →"
msgstr "回声 1  ↑ ↑ ← ← ← ↓ ↓ ↑ ↑ → →     回声 2  ↓ ↓ ← ← ← ↑ ↑ ↓ ↓ → →     出口  → → ↓ ↓ ↓ → → ↑ ↑ ↑ → →"

msgid "Nocturne"
msgstr "夜曲"

msgid "Hush"
msgstr "静息"

msgid "Negative Space"
msgstr "留空"

msgid "Coda"
msgstr "尾声"

msgid "Gate needs empty %s"
msgstr "需要让 %s 上空无一人。"

msgid "A gate marked −A needs A empty before you move. −L needs an empty lens; even one echo keeps it shut. A fading echo can open the way."
msgstr "标有 −A 的门，需要在移动前让 A 空置。−L 需要透镜上空无一人，留下一个回声也无法通过。回声消散后，路才会打开。"

msgid "A opens one gate. An empty A opens the next. Let your echo finish its part."
msgstr "A 开启第一扇门，空置的 A 开启下一扇。让回声完成它的任务。"

msgid "A minus sign marks an empty-plate gate. It checks the board before your move."
msgstr "减号表示空置门。它会在你移动之前，检查对应压板是否空着。"

msgid "End the recording on A. The echo opens the first gate, then fades before you reach the second."
msgstr "让录制停在 A。回声开启第一扇门，在你到达第二扇门前消散。"

msgid "Echo  ↑ ↑     Exit  five steps right."
msgstr "回声  ↑ ↑     出口  向右五步。"

msgid "Together at first. Then only B. Give one echo a shorter ending."
msgstr "先同时踩住两处，再只留下 B。让一个回声更早结束。"

msgid "The first gate needs both plates. The last needs B occupied and A empty."
msgstr "第一扇门需要同时踩住两块压板。最后一扇需要 B 有人、A 空置。"

msgid "Let the A recording end on beat four. Have the B recording leave its plate and return on beat six."
msgstr "让 A 的录制在第四拍结束。B 的录制离开压板一步，再在第六拍返回。"

msgid "Echo 1  ← ← ↑ ↑     Echo 2  → → ↑ ↑ ↓ ↑     Exit  ← → ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑"
msgstr "回声 1  ← ← ↑ ↑     回声 2  → → ↑ ↑ ↓ ↑     出口  ← → ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑"

msgid "Separate, meet, disappear. Three gates need three different moments."
msgstr "分开，相遇，消散。三扇门，需要三个不同的时刻。"

msgid "The first gate needs A and B. The second needs two selves on L. The final gate needs L completely empty."
msgstr "第一扇门需要 A 和 B，第二扇需要两个自己在 L 相遇，最后一扇需要 L 完全空置。"

msgid "Let both recordings end together on L. Cross the L gate on their last beat; after they fade, the last gate opens."
msgstr "让两段录制同时在 L 结束。在它们的最后一拍穿过 L 门，消散后再通过最后一扇门。"

msgid "Echo 1  ← ← ↑ ↑ → →     Echo 2  → → ↑ ↑ ← ←     Exit  ↓ ↓ → → → ↓ ↓ ↓ ↓"
msgstr "回声 1  ← ← ↑ ↑ → →     回声 2  → → ↑ ↑ ← ←     出口  ↓ ↓ → → → ↓ ↓ ↓ ↓"

msgid "Move up"
msgstr "向上移动"

msgid "Move down"
msgstr "向下移动"

msgid "Move left"
msgstr "向左移动"

msgid "Move right"
msgstr "向右移动"

msgid "Echo"
msgstr "回声"

msgid "Tap a direction to move one tile per beat. Tap Leave an Echo to record your route. Undo takes back a beat; Pause offers hints and Restart Room."
msgstr "点方向盘，每步移动一格。点“留下回声”记录路线；“撤销”退回一步，暂停菜单中可以查看提示或重开关卡。"

msgid "Tap a direction on the pad, or an adjacent tile, to move one step. Each move advances one beat.\n\nTap Leave an Echo to record your route and return to the start. Your echo retraces your steps, then fades after its last move.\n\nA plate opens its matching gate. Guide the solid dot into the outlined square to finish.\n\nUndo takes back a step. Open Pause for hints or Restart Room."
msgstr "点方向盘或相邻格子，每次移动一步。世界只在你移动时前进一步。\n\n点“留下回声”记录路线并回到起点。回声会重走这条路线，并在最后一步之后消散。\n\n踏板可以开启对应的门。让实心棋子走到空心方框中即可过关。\n\n“撤销”退回一步。暂停菜单中可以查看提示或重开关卡。"

msgid "Extra"
msgstr "额外挑战"

msgid "Escapement"
msgstr "擒纵"

msgid "The bridges read like a score. Decide what the switch must do before you leave the lens."
msgstr "沿出口方向看三座桥。离开透镜之前，开关应该处在哪个状态？"

msgid "Read the three decks from L to the exit. The first and third rise together; the middle one needs the opposite bank."
msgstr "从 L 往出口数，第一座桥和第三座桥同时升起，中间那座恰好相反。"

msgid "Send the recording to the switch before the meeting. After you meet, it must tap the switch twice more and finish on A."
msgstr "让回声先踩一次开关，再回来和你会合。分开以后，它还要踩两次开关，最后抵达 A。"

msgid "1: ↑2 ←2 →2 ←2 → ← ↑2   /   Exit: ↑2 ←2 →4 ↑2 →2 ↓"
msgstr "1: ↑2 ←2 →2 ←2 → ← ↑2   /   出口： ↑2 ←2 →4 ↑2 →2 ↓"

msgid "Understudy"
msgstr "替身"

msgid "Someone must reach B in a recording. Start by working out who could let them through the lens gate."
msgstr "得有人在录制时抵达 B。先想想，谁能替它打开透镜门？"

msgid "During the second recording, meet the first echo on L. As you enter the raised deck, that echo can change the bank for the next step."
msgstr "录第二段时，和第一段回声在 L 上会合。你踏上第一座桥的同时，让它切换桥面，接上下一步。"

msgid "The exit passage needs two visits to the switch, then quiet. Let the first echo end on A while the second is still able to return to B."
msgstr "出口这一路需要切换两次桥面。让第一段回声停录在 A，给第二段留出再次回到 B 的时间。"

msgid "1: ↑2 ←2 → ←   /   2: ↑4 →2 ← →   /   Exit: →4 ↑5"
msgstr "1: ↑2 ←2 → ←   /   2: ↑4 →2 ← →   /   出口： →4 ↑5"

msgid "Triptych"
msgstr "三联画"

msgid "Three recordings share the last crossing. Look for the room that can only be recorded after two others exist."
msgstr "第三段回声要去哪里？找找那条必须先有两段录制才能走进的侧廊。"

msgid "Trace both outside paths from their plates to L and back. Record those return trips while the upper bridges are raised."
msgstr "从两块踏板沿外侧走到 L，再原路折返。趁上方的桥还升着，把两个来回都录下来。"

msgid "The third echo must visit C twice. Between visits, send it back to the vault switch to raise the final bridge while the other two return to their plates."
msgstr "第三段回声要两次抵达 C。中途折返回侧廊的开关，让最后一座桥升起来。此时，前两段回声也该踏上各自的踏板了。"

msgid "1: ←3 ↑2 →3 ←3 ↓2   /   2: →3 ↑2 ←3 →3 ↓2   /   3: ↓2 ←2 ↓2 ← ↓ ↑ → ↑ ↓ ← ↓   /   Exit: ↓2 →2 ↓2 →3 ↑5 →"
msgstr "1: ←3 ↑2 →3 ←3 ↓2   /   2: →3 ↑2 ←3 →3 ↓2   /   3: ↓2 ←2 ↓2 ← ↓ ↑ → ↑ ↓ ← ↓   /   出口： ↓2 →2 ↓2 →3 ↑5 →"

msgid "Switchyard"
msgstr "道岔"

msgid "Look around the exit square. Each of its three doors listens to a different pair of plates."
msgstr "先绕着终点看一圈。三面各有一扇门，听的是三种不同的踏板组合。"

msgid "A and C open the north door. The other two doors need B, down the shaft below the lens. Who will be with you when you record that crossing?"
msgstr "北门听 A 和 C，另两扇门都要用到透镜下方的 B。录下穿过透镜门的那一步时，谁会和你一起站在 L 上？"

msgid "For the west door, let both recordings meet on L. One goes down the shaft, the other returns to A. On your last trip, leave the west deck raised."
msgstr "可以试试西门。让两段录制在 L 会合，一段下井，另一段回到 A。最后一趟，给自己留一座升起的西桥。"

msgid "West door   /   1: ↑2 ←8 ↓4 →4 ←4 ↓   /   2: ↑2 ←8 ↓4 →4 ↓3 ↑ ↓   /   Exit: ↓4 ←2 ↑2 ←6 ↓2 ↑2 →2 ↑2 →2"
msgstr "西门   /   1: ↑2 ←8 ↓4 →4 ←4 ↓   /   2: ↑2 ←8 ↓4 →4 ↓3 ↑ ↓   /   出口： ↓4 ←2 ↑2 ←6 ↓2 ↑2 →2 ↑2 →2"

msgid "Chapter Guide"
msgstr "章节指引"

msgid "Close Guide"
msgstr "关闭指引"

msgid "Next Step"
msgstr "下一步"

msgid "Pause Demo"
msgstr "暂停演示"

msgid "Play Demo"
msgstr "播放演示"

msgid "Each move advances one beat. Choose Leave an Echo to save your route and return to the start.\nThe hollow ring replays your steps, then fades one beat after its route ends."
msgstr "每走一步，时间前进一拍。选择「留下回声」，录下路线并回到起点。\n空心圆环会重走这条路线，在最后一步的下一拍消失。"

msgid "Move with the arrow keys or WASD. There is no time limit."
msgstr "用方向键或 WASD 移动。没有时间限制。"

msgid "Tap a direction on the pad. There is no time limit."
msgstr "点击方向盘上的方向移动。没有时间限制。"

msgid "Walk a route to the plate."
msgstr "先走到踏板上。"

msgid "Now save this route with Leave an Echo."
msgstr "选择「留下回声」，录下刚才的路线。"

msgid "Back at the start. Your hollow echo remembers the route."
msgstr "回到起点，空心回声记住了刚才的路线。"

msgid "Your move also advances the echo one step."
msgstr "你走一步，回声也沿原路走一步。"

msgid "The echo reaches A. The A gate opens."
msgstr "回声到达 A，A 门打开。"

msgid "Enter the outlined square to finish."
msgstr "走进空心方框，即可完成关卡。"

msgid "Move Together"
msgstr "一起行动"

msgid "Record each route separately. Each new recording resets the beat; all echoes then move together.\nA + B opens only when both plates are occupied before your move."
msgstr "分别录下每条路线。每次留下回声都会重置时间，随后所有回声一起行动。\n移动前，A 和 B 都有人占据，A + B 门才会打开。"

msgid "Two routes recorded. Both begin at the same starting tile."
msgstr "已录好两条路线，都从同一起点出发。"

msgid "Both echoes advance with you."
msgstr "两个回声跟随你的步伐一起前进。"

msgid "Backtracking takes a beat, too."
msgstr "往回走，也会消耗一拍。"

msgid "One echo takes the left branch; the other takes the right."
msgstr "一个回声走左边，另一个走右边。"

msgid "A and B are occupied together. The gate opens."
msgstr "A 和 B 同时有人，门打开了。"

msgid "Cross on your next move."
msgstr "下一步就可以穿过。"

msgid "Arrow Gates"
msgstr "变向门"

msgid "Cross an arrow gate in its marked direction. It reverses after the crossing.\nEchoes follow their recorded routes and can reverse arrows, too."
msgstr "沿箭头方向穿过门，穿过后箭头会反转。\n回声按录下的路线行动，也能让箭头反转。"

msgid "The arrow points to the right."
msgstr "箭头现在指向右边。"

msgid "Approach from the tail of the arrow."
msgstr "从箭头尾端靠近。"

msgid "Crossing turns the arrow to the left."
msgstr "穿过后，箭头转向左边。"

msgid "You can now cross back to the left."
msgstr "现在可以向左穿回去了。"

msgid "Each crossing reverses it again."
msgstr "每次穿过，箭头都会再次反转。"

msgid "Plan which direction you will need next."
msgstr "想想下次经过时，需要哪个方向。"

msgid "Bridges"
msgstr "升降桥"

msgid "Step onto a diamond to swap the raised and folded bridges.\nEchoes trigger diamonds, too. Their recorded routes still cross bridges that have folded."
msgstr "踩上菱形开关，两组桥会交换升起和收起的状态。\n回声也会触发开关，而且能沿录下的路线穿过已经收起的桥。"

msgid "The bridge ahead is folded."
msgstr "前方的桥处于收起状态。"

msgid "The diamond raises one bank and folds the other."
msgstr "菱形开关让一组桥升起，另一组收起。"

msgid "You can enter the raised bridge."
msgstr "现在可以踏上升起的桥。"

msgid "Another visit to a diamond would swap the banks again."
msgstr "再次踩上菱形开关，两组桥会再次交换。"

msgid "Watch both bridge banks when planning a route."
msgstr "规划路线时，留意两组桥的状态。"

msgid "Meet on the Lens"
msgstr "在透镜相遇"

msgid "L is a lens, marked by two overlapping circles. Two selves must share its tile to open an L gate.\nYou and an echo count, or two echoes while you move elsewhere."
msgstr "两个重叠的圆圈代表透镜 L。两个自己站在同一块透镜上，L 门才会打开。\n可以是你和一个回声，也可以是两个回声，而你走在别处。"

msgid "Look for the overlapping circles."
msgstr "找到两个重叠的圆圈。"

msgid "One self on L leaves the gate closed."
msgstr "只有一个自己站在 L 上，门不会打开。"

msgid "Record that visit, then return to the lens."
msgstr "录下这次到访，再走回透镜。"

msgid "Two selves meet on L. The gate opens."
msgstr "两个自己在 L 上相遇，门打开了。"

msgid "Cross on the next move, while L is active."
msgstr "趁 L 已激活，在下一步穿过门。"

msgid "The meeting only needs to last for the crossing."
msgstr "只需在穿门前的那一拍相遇。"

msgid "Leave a Space"
msgstr "留出空位"

msgid "A gate marked −A needs A empty before you move. An echo can step away or fade to open it.\n−L needs a completely empty lens; even one self keeps it shut."
msgstr "标记 −A 的门，需要移动前 A 上没有人。让回声离开或消失，就能打开它。\n−L 需要透镜完全空着，哪怕只剩一个自己，门也不会打开。"

msgid "This echo has a one-step route to A."
msgstr "这个回声的路线只有一步，终点在 A。"

msgid "A is occupied. A opens; −A stays closed."
msgstr "A 上有人，A 门打开，−A 门关闭。"

msgid "Cross A. On this beat, the echo fades and −A opens."
msgstr "穿过 A 门。这一拍回声消失，−A 门打开。"

msgid "With A empty, you can cross −A."
msgstr "A 已空出，可以穿过 −A 门。"

msgid "Wonderland"
msgstr "乐园"

msgid "Carousel"
msgstr "旋转木马"

msgid "Direction Switches"
msgstr "方向开关"

msgid "A round arrow switch flips its linked one-way doors. Crossing a door does not turn it.\nSend an echo to the switch while you take another branch."
msgstr "踩上圆形箭头开关，会反转它连接的单向门。穿过门不会改变方向。\n让回声去操作开关，你就可以走另一条路。"

msgid "The door faces left. An echo will visit the switch."
msgstr "门朝向左边，回声即将去操作开关。"

msgid "The echo steps on the switch. The door turns right."
msgstr "回声踩上开关，门转向右边。"

msgid "Crossing leaves the arrow pointing right."
msgstr "穿过之后，箭头仍然朝右。"

msgid "Only another switch visit can reverse it."
msgstr "只有再次踩下开关，方向才会反转。"

msgid "Plan when your echo should change the doors."
msgstr "安排好让回声切换门方向的时机。"

msgid "A round arrow switch flips its linked one-way doors. Crossing a door does not turn it. Echoes can operate the switch from another branch."
msgstr "圆形箭头开关控制相连的单向门。穿过门不会改变方向，回声可以在远处的分支上操作开关。"

msgid "The arrow switches control both doors. Passing through a door does not change its direction."
msgstr "箭头开关同时控制两扇门，穿过门不会改变它的方向。"

msgid "The two doors face opposite ways. Someone outside the carousel must change them after you enter."
msgstr "两扇门的朝向相反。你进入旋转木马之后，需要外面的自己再切换一次方向。"

msgid "Meet both echoes on L to enter. Then send one back to the arrow switch before they reach A and B. You can loop inside while they travel."
msgstr "让两个回声在 L 相遇，帮你进入。再让其中一个回到箭头开关，最后分别到达 A 和 B。你可以在内部环道上绕行配合。"

msgid "Record UUUDDRRUUDDDD, then UUUDDRRUULLRR. Finally walk UUDDRRRRURRDRR."
msgstr "先录下 上上上下下右右上上下下下下，再录下 上上上下下右右上上左左右右。最后走 上上下下右右右右上右右下右右。"

msgid "Inferno"
msgstr "地狱"

msgid "Cinder Walk"
msgstr "踏烬"

msgid "Afterburn"
msgstr "余焰"

msgid "Furnace"
msgstr "熔炉"

msgid "Damnation"
msgstr "炼狱"

msgid "That group sinks on the next beat."
msgstr "这一组会在下一拍沉入岩浆。"

msgid "Lava Cycle"
msgstr "岩浆轮转"

msgid "Four groups take turns sinking. Match the dots on tiles to the numbered cycle.\nThe triangle marks the group sinking next. Land on a safe tile; a group can rise as you step onto it."
msgstr "四组地面轮流沉没，格子上的圆点数量对应上方的组号。\n三角形标出下一拍沉没的一组。选择落脚时安全的格子，刚才沉没的地面也可能在你踏上时升起。"

msgid "Group 2 sinks next. Take the lower route."
msgstr "下一拍第 2 组沉没，先走下面的路。"

msgid "Group 1 rises as group 2 sinks."
msgstr "第 1 组恢复，第 2 组同时沉没。"

msgid "A detour advances the cycle, too."
msgstr "绕路也会让岩浆前进一拍。"

msgid "Group 2 is safe again. You can step onto it."
msgstr "第 2 组已经恢复，现在可以踏上去。"

msgid "The cycle repeats every four beats."
msgstr "每四拍，轮转回到同一组。"

msgid "Take your time. Only your moves change the lava."
msgstr "慢慢规划，只有移动才会改变岩浆。"

msgid "Lava advances one group per move. Match the dots on tiles to the cycle above the board. The triangle marks the group sinking next; choose a tile that is safe when you land. Invalid moves cost no beat."
msgstr "每走一步，岩浆轮换一组。格子上的圆点数量对应棋盘上方的组号，三角形标出下一拍沉没的一组。选择落脚时安全的格子，无效移动不会消耗步数。"

msgid "Watch the triangle. It marks the group that will sink when you take your next step."
msgstr "留意三角形，它标出你下一步移动时会沉没的一组。"

msgid "A tile can rise as you step onto it. Plan for the next group, rather than avoiding every tile that is submerged now."
msgstr "格子可以在你踏上时恢复。看下一拍的预告，当前沉没的地面也可能成为下一步的落脚点。"

msgid "The lower crossing and the upper loop reach the exit on different beats. Let your echo visit A at the beat before you cross a gate."
msgstr "下方通道和上方环路的到达时间不同，让回声在你穿门前一拍踩到 A。"

msgid "The lens meeting and the return to A must both fit the lava cycle."
msgstr "在透镜相遇和随后返回 A，都需要配合岩浆的轮转。"

msgid "After meeting on L, the echo still needs a safe route back to A."
msgstr "在 L 相遇后，回声还需要一条能安全返回 A 的路线。"

msgid "The loop beyond L buys time for your echo. Choose the upper or lower exit gate to match its arrival at A."
msgstr "L 后面的环路可以为回声争取时间，选择从上方或下方的门到达终点，配合它回到 A。"

msgid "One switch controls the entrance and all four exit doors. The lava cycle controls which approach is safe."
msgstr "一个开关同时控制入口和四扇出口门，岩浆的轮转决定哪条路此时安全。"

msgid "The exit doors close when the entrance opens. Arrange another switch visit after you enter."
msgstr "入口打开时，出口门会关闭。安排在你进入之后，再踩一次开关。"

msgid "Let the two echoes meet on L, then send them to A and B. One of them must operate the arrow switch along the way."
msgstr "让两个回声在 L 相遇，再分别走向 A 和 B。其中一个需要途中操作箭头开关。"

msgid "First occupy A and B together. Later, keep B occupied while A is empty."
msgstr "先同时占据 A 和 B，随后需要 A 空着，而 B 仍有人。"

msgid "The A echo can end its route after the entrance opens. The B echo needs a later return."
msgstr "A 上的回声可以在入口打开后结束路线，B 上的回声则需要稍后再次返回。"

msgid "The inner ring offers two routes. Count the lava phases as well as the beats until A fades and B returns."
msgstr "内环有两条走法，除了岩浆轮转，还要算好 A 上回声消失和 B 上回声返回的时间。"

msgid "Record UUDUDUDURL. Finally walk UUDURRRRDD."
msgstr "先录下 上上下上下上下上右左。最后走 上上下上右右右右下下。"

msgid "Record UDRRRLDUUULLRL. Finally walk UDRRRRDDUDRRUU."
msgstr "先录下 上下右右右左下上上上左左右左。最后走 上下右右右右下下上下右右上上。"

msgid "Record UUDDDDDUUUUU, then UUDRRDRLUDDD. Finally walk UUDRRDRRUDUDR."
msgstr "先录下 上上下下下下下上上上上上，再录下 上上下右右下右左上下下下。最后走 上上下右右下右右上下上下右。"

msgid "Record UUUUDUUURLRLRLDURLDU, then UUUUDUDDRRDDUUDDUUDDU. Finally walk UUUUDURRUDRRDDUDRRRUUR."
msgstr "先录下 上上上上下上上上右左右左右左下上右左下上，再录下 上上上上下上下下右右下下上上下下上上下下上。最后走 上上上上下上右右上下右右下下上下右右右上上右。"

msgid "Record UUDUUDDUDDRRUUDDU, then UUDURRUUUULLRLDUD. Finally walk UUDUUDDURRUURRRRRR."
msgstr "先录下 上上下上上下下上下下右右上上下下上，再录下 上上下上右右上上上上左左右左下上下。最后走 上上下上上下下上右右上上右右右右右右。"

msgid "Record UUDUDUDURL. Finally walk UUDURRDDRR."
msgstr "先录下 上上下上下上下上右左。最后走 上上下上右右下下右右。"

msgid "Record UDRRUDRLUUDULR. Finally walk UDRRUDRRDDUURR."
msgstr "先录下 上下右右上下右左上上下上左右。最后走 上下右右上下右右下下上上右右。"

msgid "Paradox"
msgstr "悖论"

msgid "Three recordings, three endings. Which self will you leave behind?"
msgstr "三段回声，三种结局。你会让哪一个自己退场？"

msgid "B listens to A. The lower chamber listens to both. Your first recording must make the next two recordings possible."
msgstr "B 的门听从 A，下方房间的门需要 A 和 B。第一段回声需要为之后两段录制创造条件。"

msgid "Meet the two older echoes on L while the third visits C. Record the gallery crossings before changing the bridge bank."
msgstr "让前两个回声在 L 相遇，同时让第三个到达 C。先录下高台上的过桥路线，再改变两组桥的状态。"

msgid "Each exit wants two occupied plates and one empty plate. An echo ending at L can be as useful as one returning to a plate."
msgstr "每扇出口都需要两块踏板有人，另一块空着。让回声在 L 结束，有时和让它返回踏板一样有用。"

msgid "West / 1: L3 D U D U D U3 R3 L3 D3 U D / 2: R2 L R2 D U2 L2 U L R L R D2 R L R2 D / 3: D2 U D U D3 R L2 R L R / Exit: D2 R4 L D L U R D U R2 U2 R2 L2 D R"
msgstr "西门 / 1：左3 下 上 下 上 下 上3 右3 左3 下3 上 下 / 2：右2 左 右2 下 上2 左2 上 左 右 左 右 下2 右 左 右2 下 / 3：下2 上 下 上 下3 右 左2 右 左 右 / 出口：下2 右4 左 下 左 上 右 下 上 右2 上2 右2 左2 下 右"

msgid "Open the ECHO repository"
msgstr "打开 ECHO 的 GitHub 仓库"

msgid "Slipstream"
msgstr "流隙"

msgid "Fold"
msgstr "折叠"

msgid "Short Circuit"
msgstr "短路"

msgid "Crossfade"
msgstr "交叠"

msgid "Event Horizon"
msgstr "事件视界"

msgid "Portals"
msgstr "传送门"

msgid "Currents"
msgstr "疾行道"

msgid "Chains"
msgstr "连锁"

msgid "This current loops back on itself."
msgstr "这段疾行道形成了循环。"

msgid "The route returns to its starting tile."
msgstr "这条路线会回到原地。"

msgid "Matching broken rings form a portal pair. Step into either ring to appear at the other end on the same beat.\nThe exit does not send you straight back. Echoes remember the jump, too."
msgstr "相同编号的断环组成一对传送门。走入一端，这一拍就会从另一端出现。\n出口不会立即把你传回来。回声也会记住这次传送。"

msgid "The matching I rings connect these two islands."
msgstr "编号 I 的两个断环连接着这两座小岛。"

msgid "One move takes you through both ends. Beat 1."
msgstr "移动一次，穿过两端。现在是第 1 拍。"

msgid "Step away from the exit ring normally."
msgstr "下一步可以正常走出出口环。"

msgid "Arrows carry you along until an ordinary tile. You cannot stop or steer in the middle.\nThe entire ride is one beat. A blocked gate or unsafe tile cancels the whole move."
msgstr "箭头会一直带你前进，直到普通格。途中不能停下或转向。\n整段只算一拍。途中有关闭的门或危险格，这一步就会取消。"

msgid "Approach the arrows."
msgstr "先靠近箭头。"

msgid "This ordinary step takes one beat."
msgstr "普通的一步占一拍。"

msgid "The whole current takes one beat, too."
msgstr "走完整段疾行道，也只占一拍。"

msgid "Your echoes advance once during a ride."
msgstr "疾行期间，每条回声也只前进一步。"

msgid "A portal exit can feed into a current, then another portal. Follow the chain to its final landing tile.\nEvery gate along the way uses the board before your move. The chain still costs only one beat."
msgstr "传送门出口可以连接疾行道，再进入另一对传送门。顺着连锁找到最终落点。\n沿途所有门都按移动前的状态判定，整条连锁仍然只占一拍。"

msgid "One move can link two portal pairs."
msgstr "一次移动可以串联两对传送门。"

msgid "Both jumps and the current cost one beat."
msgstr "两次传送加一段疾行，总共只占一拍。"

msgid "You stop on the first ordinary landing tile."
msgstr "你会停在连锁后的第一个普通格。"

msgid "Two islands, one beat apart. The matching rings connect them."
msgstr "两座小岛，相隔一拍。同编号的断环将它们相连。"

msgid "Cross the express lane while your echo reaches A. A whole current is one beat."
msgstr "让回声前往 A，同时走上疾行道。整段疾行只占一拍。"

msgid "Meet on the lens, swap the bridge banks, then split between A and B."
msgstr "在透镜上相会，切换桥组，再分别前往 A 和 B。"

msgid "Link two portal pairs in one move. Enter together, then let one echo go."
msgstr "一步串联两对传送门。一起打开入口，再让一条回声消散。"

msgid "The matching broken rings are connected. Enter either end to leave the other on the same beat."
msgstr "同编号的断环相连。走入一端，这一拍就从另一端走出。"

msgid "Use the portal to record a visit to A. Your next self can take the lower path."
msgstr "通过传送门录下前往 A 的路线。下一轮的你可以走下方的路。"

msgid "The arrows carry you to the first ordinary tile. The whole ride costs one beat."
msgstr "箭头会把你带到第一个普通格。整段路只占一拍。"

msgid "A is only two steps away. Let your echo handle it while you use the express lane."
msgstr "A 离起点只有两步。让回声负责 A，你来走疾行道。"

msgid "The portal lands on the lens. Arrange a meeting there after one self has raised bank b."
msgstr "传送门出口就在透镜上。先让一个自己升起 b 桥组，再安排会合。"

msgid "The first echo must revisit the diamond: b gets your second recording out; a gets you home."
msgstr "第一条回声需要再次踩菱形：b 桥组让第二条录制通过，a 桥组让你抵达出口。"

msgid "Use the lower loop to arrive after the bridge swap. The short current changes your arrival beat."
msgstr "利用下方回路，在桥组切换后抵达。短疾行道会改变你的到达拍数。"

msgid "A portal exit can feed into a current and then another portal. The whole chain is still one beat."
msgstr "传送门出口可以接上疾行道，再进入另一对传送门。整条连锁仍然只算一拍。"

msgid "Record A first. Its first visit admits the B recording; its later visit admits you."
msgstr "先录制 A。它第一次到访时放行 B 的录制，之后再次到访时放行你。"

msgid "The inner gate needs A and B. The exit needs B without A: end one recording, and bring the other back."
msgstr "内门需要 A 和 B，出口需要有 B、无 A：结束一条录制，让另一条再次返回。"

msgid "Record DLU. Finally walk RRRR."
msgstr "先录制 DLU，最后走 RRRR。"

msgid "Record UU. Finally walk RRR."
msgstr "先录制 UU，最后走 RRR。"

msgid "Record RRUDLRLULRRLLRL, then RLRLRRRRRRURLRL. Finally walk DRLRLRLRLRRRURRR."
msgstr "先录制 RRUDLRLULRRLLRL，再录制 RLRLRRRRRRURLRL，最后走 DRLRLRLRLRRRURRR。"

msgid "Record RUUURULLLRLRL, then LLLLURUDUUUDUDU. Finally walk LLLLULDDDLRLURRR."
msgstr "先录制 RUUURULLLRLRL，再录制 LLLLURUDUUUDUDU，最后走 LLLLULDDDLRLURRR。"

msgid "Choose a direction each beat. Tap Leave an Echo to record your route. Undo takes back a beat; Pause offers hints and Restart Room."
msgstr "每拍选择一个方向。点击“留下回声”录制路线；“撤销”退回一拍；暂停中可查看提示或重开关卡。"

msgid "Choose a direction each beat. Press Enter to leave an echo. Z undoes a beat. R restarts the room and clears all echoes."
msgstr "每拍选择一个方向。Enter 留下回声，Z 撤销一拍，R 重开关卡并清除所有回声。"

msgid "Matching portal rings connect distant tiles. Arrows carry you to an ordinary tile. A whole chain is one beat; if any part is blocked, the move is cancelled. Echoes remember the complete route."
msgstr "同编号的传送环连接远处的格子，箭头会把你带到普通格。整条连锁只算一拍；任何一处受阻，整步取消。回声会记住完整路线。"

msgid "Cloister"
msgstr "回廊"

msgid "Kaleidoscope"
msgstr "万花镜"

msgid "Two mirrored courtyards. Give your echoes the two outer posts."
msgstr "两座相映的庭院。让回声守住两端。"

msgid "A and B open every approach to the exit. Choose a route through either courtyard."
msgstr "A 和 B 同时占用时，出口的三扇门都会打开。可以选择任一庭院的路线。"

msgid "A short detour lets both recordings arrive before you cross."
msgstr "绕行一小段，让两条回声先到，再穿过出口。"

msgid "Record LLLL, then RRRR. Finally walk UDUUU."
msgstr "先录制 LLLL，再录制 RRRR，最后走 UDUUU。"

msgid "A clockwise frame, two folded rings, and an exit at the centre."
msgstr "顺时针的外框，两条折叠的环路，出口就在正中。"

msgid "A opens the east approach. B opens the west. Either plan can finish this room."
msgstr "A 打开东侧入口，B 打开西侧入口。两种方案都可以通关。"

msgid "Try both the flowing outer frame and the quiet inner ring. Their travel times are different."
msgstr "试试疾行的外框和安静的内环，它们需要的拍数不同。"

msgid "Record LUURDD. Finally walk LURRRR."
msgstr "先录制 LUURDD，最后走 LURRRR。"

msgid "Prism"
msgstr "棱镜"

msgid "Mirror Routes"
msgstr "镜像路线"

msgid "An echo holds one wing while you climb the other. Look for the plate that opens the door across the mirror."
msgstr "让回声守住一翼，你从另一翼攀登。找一找，哪块踏板能打开镜子另一端的门？"

msgid "An echo will climb the left wing. Take the right."
msgstr "回声会沿左翼上行。你走右翼。"

msgid "Each of you takes a different wing."
msgstr "你们一左一右，各走一边。"

msgid "Climb in step with your reflection."
msgstr "和倒影一起向上走。"

msgid "The echo reaches A. Your door opens."
msgstr "回声站上了 A，你这侧的门开了。"

msgid "Cross before the reflection fades."
msgstr "趁倒影还在，跨过门。"

msgid "Ferris Wheel"
msgstr "摩天轮"

msgid "One rider works the axle. The other takes a cabin to the crown."
msgstr "一个人穿过轮轴，另一个人坐上吊舱，在轮顶碰面。"

msgid "The switch at the hub turns both upper doors inward. Each side of the crown needs the opposite cabin occupied."
msgstr "轮轴的开关能转动顶部的两扇单向门。要从一侧登顶，另一侧的吊舱里得有人。"

msgid "Send your echo through the hub and out to A. Take the right rim yourself. The mirror route works too."
msgstr "让回声穿过轮轴去 A，你从右边绕轮缘上行。左右对调也能登顶。"

msgid "Record UDUDUUUULLLUL. Ride RURRUUUUUULLUL."
msgstr "录制UDUDUUUULLLUL，最后走 RURRUUUUUULLUL。"

msgid "Rose Window"
msgstr "玫瑰花窗"

msgid "A rose window in four petals. Open the upper pane, then bring two reflections into its lens."
msgstr "四瓣花窗。先推开上方的窗扇，再让两道倒影回到花心。"

msgid "Split the echoes between A and B to enter the upper petal. The last door opens when both echoes meet on the lens."
msgstr "两道回声分站 A 和 B，你就能进入上方的花瓣。最后一道门要靠它们在花心的透镜上相遇。"

msgid "Give the recordings mirror routes of equal length. You can take either side of the upper petal."
msgstr "让两道回声走一对等长的镜像路线。你走上方花瓣的左边或右边都可以。"

msgid "Record LULUULLULUURURRDRDR, then RURUURRURUULULLDLDL. Walk LULUUURUUULUUDUDURUR."
msgstr "录制LULUULLULUURURRDRDR、RURUURRURUULULLDLDL，最后走 LULUUURUUULUUDUDURUR。"

msgid "Sugar Spiral"
msgstr "棒棒糖"

msgid "The stick splits into two ribbons. The sugar at the centre unwraps when the outer ribbon reaches A."
msgstr "沿糖棍往上，两道糖纹在这里分开。外圈踩到 A，糖心就打开了。"

msgid "Follow the rim with your recording. You can trace the inner curl yourself."
msgstr "让回声沿糖果边缘走，你沿着内侧卷纹绕向糖心。"

msgid "Count from the fork. Arrive beside the centre as your echo reaches the top."
msgstr "从分岔处开始数拍。回声登顶时，你要走到糖心旁边。"

msgid "Record UUUUULLLLUUURURURRR. Walk UUULLULURUURURRDRDLL."
msgstr "先录制 UUUUULLLLUUURURURRR，最后走 UUULLULURUURURRDRDLL。"

msgid "Afterglow"
msgstr "余晖"

msgid "Borrow the light of the upper star tip. Enter while it shines and cross the centre when it goes dark."
msgstr "借一点星尖的光。亮时走进内门，熄灭后穿入星心。"

msgid "The upper tip holds A. Record a walk that ends there."
msgstr "A 在顶部的星尖。录下一条刚好在那里结束的路线。"

msgid "Take the opposite arm. Enter on the last beat of light; the echo fades as you step inside."
msgstr "沿另一侧星芒上行。趁最后一拍星光进入内门，这一步落下时回声刚好消散。"

msgid "Record UULULUURURUU. Walk UURURUULULLDDR."
msgstr "先录制 UULULUURURUU，最后走 UURURUULULLDDR。"

msgid "Cloudbreak"
msgstr "云隙"

msgid "Two clouds meet across a narrow gap. Send an echo over the high crest and walk the low shelf yourself."
msgstr "两朵云隔着一道小缝。让回声走高高的云顶，你沿低处的云边走。"

msgid "The plate sits at the tip of the upper cloud. Look for its gate along the low crossing."
msgstr "踏板就在大云伸出的尖端，它控制着下方云隙处的门。"

msgid "Use the small loop beside the start to line up the two arrivals."
msgstr "借起点旁边的小圈绕一步，让两边同时抵达。"

msgid "Record URURURRRRDR. Walk URDDRRRRURRRURUR."
msgstr "先录制 URURURRRRDR，最后走 URDDRRRRURRRURUR。"

msgid "Orbit"
msgstr "轨道"

msgid "Nexus"
msgstr "枢纽"

msgid "Satellite"
msgstr "卫星"

msgid "Crescent"
msgstr "弦月"

msgid "Binary"
msgstr "双星"

msgid "Periapsis"
msgstr "近星点"

msgid "Aperture"
msgstr "光圈"

msgid "Hologram"
msgstr "全息"

msgid "Reactor"
msgstr "反应堆"

msgid "Warp"
msgstr "跃迁"

msgid "Two solar wings, one rendezvous. Their shapes match; their routes need not."
msgstr "两翼太阳帆，一次会合。形状相映，路线各有不同。"

msgid "A is near the top of one wing. B sits halfway down the other. Match the arrival beats."
msgstr "A 在一翼上端，B 在另一翼中部。让两条路线在同一拍抵达。"

msgid "A small circuit inside a solar panel gives the shorter journey more time."
msgstr "在太阳帆内部绕一小圈，就能延长较短的那段旅程。"

msgid "Record UUULLUULDDLUU, then UUURRUURDDDRU. Walk UUULLULDRRRUUU."
msgstr "先录制 UUULLUULDDLUU，再录制 UUURRUURDDDRU，最后走 UUULLULDRRRUUU。"

msgid "Follow the silver crescent. One echo reaches its dark edge while you round the inner curve."
msgstr "沿着银色弦月，让回声抵达暗面，你绕过内侧的弧线。"

msgid "The plate is on the outer edge; the exit lies at the lower tip. The crescent offers two paths around its hollow."
msgstr "踏板在外缘，出口在下端。弦月的空心旁有两条路线。"

msgid "Use the wider upper crescent to delay the echo before it reaches A."
msgstr "利用较宽的上端绕行一圈，让回声晚一点踩到 A。"

msgid "Record LDLULDDLULLDLDD. Walk LDLLDLDDDDDDRRRR."
msgstr "先录制 LDLULDDLULLDLDD，最后走 LDLLDLDDDDDDRRRR。"

msgid "Two stars share one lens. Fold each orbit through the opposite star."
msgstr "两颗恒星共享一枚透镜。让每条轨道折向另一颗星。"

msgid "Both recorded routes must meet on L while you approach the upper exit."
msgstr "两条录制路线需要在 L 上会合，此时你应接近上方出口。"

msgid "Each portal switches stars. Follow the rings beyond the jump to return to the lens."
msgstr "每次传送都会换到另一颗星。跳跃之后继续沿环绕行，回到透镜。"

msgid "Record URRRRRDDDDLLLLDDL, then ULLLLLDDDDRRRRDDR. Walk UUUUULDDDDRUUULURU."
msgstr "先录制 URRRRRDDDDLLLLDDL，再录制 ULLLLLDDDDRRRRDDR，最后走 UUUUULDDDDRUUULURU。"

msgid "Meet at the near side of the rings. Then let one signal disappear."
msgstr "在双环的近侧会合，再让其中一道信号消失。"

msgid "The first door needs A and B. The last needs B with A empty."
msgstr "第一道门需要 A 与 B 同时占用，最后一道门需要 B 占用、A 空出。"

msgid "End the A route at its plate. Give B one later return so it can outlast A."
msgstr "让 A 路线在踏板处结束，B 路线再多一次返回，撑过 A 消失的那一拍。"

msgid "Record LLUULLLUUU, then RRUURRRUUUUD. Walk UULLDDRRUUUUU."
msgstr "先录制 LLUULLLUUU，再录制 RRUURRRUUUUD，最后走 UULLDDRRUUUUU。"

msgid "A remote projector makes the iris solid. Send your echo along one blade and take another."
msgstr "远处的投影器会让光圈凝实。让回声沿一片扇叶走，你走另一片。"

msgid "The broken cyan corners mark a projected tile. A must be occupied before you step onto it."
msgstr "青色断角标出投影格。踏上之前，A 必须已经有人。"

msgid "If the light goes out beneath you, step off onto a solid tile. You do not need to keep it lit after crossing."
msgstr "脚下的光消失后，可以走到实心格上。跨过去之后就能让投影熄灭。"

msgid "Record UULLUULLUU. Walk UURRRRUULLLL."
msgstr "先录制 UULLUULLUU，最后走 UURRRRUULLLL。"

msgid "Three projectors, three crossings. Walk in step across the empty corridor."
msgstr "三个投影器，三段通路。跟着回声的脚步，跨过悬空走廊。"

msgid "The left corridor carries A, B, and C. Their projections cross the right corridor."
msgstr "左侧走廊依次经过 A、B、C，对应右侧的三条投影带。"

msgid "Keep both journeys in step. A whole row needs the same projector, so changing columns will not skip it."
msgstr "让两侧逐拍同步。一整排都需要同一个投影器，换列也要经过它。"

msgid "Record LLUUUUUU. Walk RRUUUUUUUU."
msgstr "先录制 LLUUUUUU，最后走 RRUUUUUUUU。"

msgid "A powers the outer span. A and B together project the path into the core."
msgstr "A 点亮外侧通路，A 与 B 一同投影通向核心的路。"

msgid "Give each echo a path around the outside. Visit A again while you are already inside the first ring."
msgstr "让两道回声沿外缘走。在你进入内环之后，再次踩到 A。"

msgid "A short circuit around each upper corner can bring both echoes back for the inner span."
msgstr "在两处上角各绕一圈，让回声再次返回，点亮内侧通路。"

msgid "Record LLLLUUUUUUUURDLU, then RRRRUUUUUUUULDRU. Walk LLLLUUUUUUDDRRURDR."
msgstr "先录制 LLLLUUUUUUUURDLU，再录制 RRRRUUUUUUUULDRU，最后走 LLLLUUUUUUDDRRURDR。"

msgid "The portal docks fold opposite corners together. Rejoin through a bridge made of light."
msgstr "传送坞连接彼此对角的浮台。借一道光桥，重新回到中央。"

msgid "Either portal carries you to the opposite upper island. Both upper posts power the central spans."
msgstr "任一传送环都会带你到对侧的上方浮台。两个上方踏板共同控制中央的光桥。"

msgid "Record a visit to each upper post, then choose a dock and approach the core from another side."
msgstr "分别录下抵达两处上方踏板的路线，再选择一个传送坞，从另一侧接近核心。"

msgid "Record LLULLDLLLLLUL, then RRURRDRRRRRUR. Walk LLULUUUUURRRDDD."
msgstr "先录制 LLULLDLLLLLUL，再录制 RRURRDRRRRRUR，最后走 LLULUUUUURRRDDD。"

msgid "A projector makes its matching holographic tiles solid before your move. When its last occupant leaves, the light fades. You can step off a vanished tile; echoes finish their recorded routes."
msgstr "投影器在你移动之前亮起，才能踏入对应的全息格。最后一个人离开，光就消失。你可以走出已经消失的格子，回声也会完成录下的路线。"

msgid "This holographic bridge needs its projector."
msgstr "这座全息桥需要对应的投影器亮起。"

msgid "Orbital Rendezvous"
msgstr "轨道会合"

msgid "Two routes can have different shapes and still reach their posts on the same beat. Record each journey, then cross while both signals are present."
msgstr "两条路线的形状可以不同，但需要在同一拍抵达。分别录下行程，再趁两道信号同时存在时穿过门。"

msgid "Both wings have a recorded route."
msgstr "两翼各有一条录制好的路线。"

msgid "Take the short path toward the exit."
msgstr "沿短路接近出口。"

msgid "One extra loop changes your arrival beat."
msgstr "多绕一下，就会改变抵达的拍数。"

msgid "Both signals arrive together. Cross next."
msgstr "两道信号同时抵达，下一步穿过门。"

msgid "The rendezvous needs to last only for the crossing."
msgstr "只需在跨过门的那一刻会合。"

msgid "Holographic Bridges"
msgstr "全息桥"

msgid "The broken corners are a bridge waiting for light."
msgstr "断角是一座等待点亮的桥。"

msgid "Your echo approaches the projector."
msgstr "回声正在接近投影器。"

msgid "A is occupied. The bridge becomes solid."
msgstr "A 已占用，桥变成了实心。"

msgid "Cross now. The echo fades and the light switches off beneath you."
msgstr "这一步跨过来。回声消散，脚下的光随之熄灭。"

msgid "You can step off the vanished bridge onto solid ground."
msgstr "你可以从消失的桥上走到实心地面。"

msgid "Projection requires %s"
msgstr "投影需要 %s"

msgid "The second wing opens only when the first sends a signal. Record the handoff, then bring both signals back together."
msgstr "第二翼要等第一翼发出信号才会打开。先录下交接，再让两道信号重新会合。"

msgid "The A door controls entry to the right solar wing. Your B recording needs an earlier A echo."
msgstr "A 门控制右翼入口。录制 B 路线之前，需要已有的 A 回声。"

msgid "Visit A twice: once to admit the B recording, then again for the final rendezvous. Use the panel loop to time its return."
msgstr "两次踩到 A：第一次让 B 路线进入右翼，第二次参加最后的会合。用太阳帆内部的小圈调整返回时机。"

msgid "Record UUULLUULDLURDLU, then UUULLULDRRRRRRR. Walk UUULLUULDDRRRUUU."
msgstr "先录制 UUULLUULDLURDLU，再录制 UUULLULDRRRRRRR，最后走 UUULLUULDDRRRUUU。"

msgid "The outer moon sends two signals in sequence. Open the inner crossing, then light the far tip."
msgstr "月亮外缘依次发出两道信号。先打开内侧通道，再点亮远端月尖。"

msgid "A opens both entrances to the inner curve. B controls the lower tip; the outer pocket has no path to the exit."
msgstr "A 打开内弧的两个入口，B 控制下方月尖。外缘的小口袋无法直接通向出口。"

msgid "Let the echo leave A for B after you enter the inner curve. One circuit around the lower pocket brings B back at the right moment."
msgstr "进入内弧后，让回声离开 A 去往 B。在下方口袋绕一圈，B 就能在你抵达时再次亮起。"

msgid "Record LDLLLLLDLDDDDRDLURD. Walk LDLULLDRDLDDDDDDRRRR."
msgstr "先录制 LDLLLLLDLDDDDRDLURD，最后走 LDLULLDRDLDDDDDDRRRR。"

msgid "Two isolated stars feed a shared exit. Only their paired portals can carry a recording between the orbits."
msgstr "两颗分离的恒星共同点亮出口。录制路线必须借成对的传送环，才能跨越轨道。"

msgid "The central shortcut is gone. Both approaches to the exit need A and B; find which portal exit leads toward each post."
msgstr "中央没有捷径。出口两侧都需要 A 与 B，先找出每个传送出口分别通向哪处踏板。"

msgid "A portal landing does not bounce you back. Walk off the ring before entering it again to choose your next orbit."
msgstr "到达传送出口不会立刻传回。先走出传送环，再次进入它，才能选择下一段轨道。"

msgid "Record LULLLLDUUU, then LULLLLDDDU. Walk LULLLLLLLLLU."
msgstr "先录制 LULLLLDUUU，再录制 LULLLLDDDU，最后走 LULLLLLLLLLU。"

msgid "One recording powers the upper blade. A second crosses that light to become the projector for the central iris."
msgstr "一道录制点亮上方扇叶，第二道借光穿过，成为中央光圈的投影器。"

msgid "A powers the two approaches to B. B powers every entrance to the core. You cannot record the B route first."
msgstr "A 点亮通往 B 的两条路，B 点亮核心的全部入口。B 路线无法最先录制。"

msgid "Record A, then use that echo to reach B. On the final round, the B echo remembers its crossing even after A has faded."
msgstr "先录制 A，再借它的回声抵达 B。最后一轮，A 即使已经消散，B 回声仍会重走录下的跨越。"

msgid "Record UULLUULUULDRUL, then UULLUULUURRRUURR. Walk UULLUULULURDLDRRRR."
msgstr "先录制 UULLUULUULDRUL，再录制 UULLUULUURRRUURR，最后走 UULLUULULURDLDRRRR。"

msgid "The projector order and the crossing order disagree. Rewrite the echo route so the right light arrives first."
msgstr "投影器的顺序与光桥的顺序并不相同。调整回声路线，让正确的光先抵达。"

msgid "The bridges ask for B, then A, then C. Walking straight past A, B, and C cannot open them in that order."
msgstr "光桥依次需要 B、A、C。直接沿 A、B、C 向上走，无法按这个顺序点亮它们。"

msgid "Reach B first, return to A, then head toward C. Use the solid landing rows to adjust your own arrival beat."
msgstr "先去 B，回到 A，再前往 C。利用光桥之间的实心平台调整自己的抵达拍数。"

msgid "Record LLUUUUDDUUUU. Walk RRUULRUUUULRUU."
msgstr "先录制 LLUUUUDDUUUU，最后走 RRUULRUUUULRUU。"

msgid "This route no longer matches the room. Begin a new route."
msgstr "原来的路线已不适用于这一关，请从起点重新规划。"
